* {{l|is|há-}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{m|non|hár}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{m|gem-pro|*hērą}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|is}} {{m|ine-pro|*keres-||rough hair, bristle}}.

====Noun====
{{is-noun|n|hárs|hár}}

# [[hair]]
#: {{usex|non|Þú hefur fallegt '''hárin'''.|You have pretty hairs.}}

=====Declension=====
{{is-decl-noun-n-s|h|á|r}}

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|is|hárgreiðsla}}
* {{l|is|hárþurrka}}
