* {{l|is|skapahár}}
* {{l|is|skírnarhár}}

=====Related terms=====
* {{l|is|hæra}}

===Etymology 3===
Cognate with the Faroese {{m|fo|háur}}, {{m|fo|hávur}},<ref>{{R:Íslensk orðsifjabók 1989}}</ref> Norwegian {{m|no|hai}} and Swedish {{m|sv|haj}}.

